  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-ethnic dialogue - Ship to Bosnia conf&apos;s</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Interetnisk dialog</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projektet t&#xE4;cker fortsatt samarbete med ODL (Open Society Lipnica). Ma vill sprida den interetniska dialogen i det bosniska samh&#xE4;llet och anv&#xE4;nda ODL &#xE4;ven i andra delar av landet. Projektet best&#xE5;r av sex konferenser, workshops, tv&#xE5; seminarier, resor, expertmedverkan och information kring aktiviteterna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The project covers continued co-operation with ODL (Open Society Lipnica) in Lipnica, Bosnia. The aim is to spread inter-ethnic dialogue in the Bosnian society and to use ODL for this purpose even in other parts of Bosnia. The project consists of six conferences, adjacent workshops, two seminars, travel costs and promotion.</narrative>
  </description>
